From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:10:57 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246: Enable
 the flash LED
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The rear camera's LED hangs off the first channel of the PM6150L's
flash module. Enable it with the vendor's flash timeout, and with the
flash and torch currents its camera actually uses, which stay under the
vendor's own maxima.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts    | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index 882bda8d7..e9eadff41 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 
 #include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/input/input.h>
+#include <dt-bindings/leds/common.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/pinctrl/qcom,pmic-gpio.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/regulator/qcom,rpmh-regulator.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h>
@@ -802,6 +803,24 @@ &pil_wlan_mem {
 	reg = <0x0 0x82a00000 0x0 0x300000>;
 };
 
+&pm6150l_flash {
+	status = "okay";
+
+	/*
+	 * The rear LED, on the first channel. The vendor's limits are
+	 * 1.5 A of flash for 300 ms and 500 mA of torch, but its camera
+	 * asks for 1.2 A at most and lights the torch at 300 mA.
+	 */
+	cam_flash: led-0 {
+		function = LED_FUNCTION_FLASH;
+		color = <LED_COLOR_ID_WHITE>;
+		led-sources = <1>;
+		led-max-microamp = <300000>;
+		flash-max-microamp = <1200000>;
+		flash-max-timeout-us = <300000>;
+	};
+};
+
 &pm6150l_gpios {
 	panel_vddio_en: panel-vddio-en-state {
 		pins = "gpio9";
